=== drawable geometry derivation (nominal) ===
  w=2.0e-6  l=1.0e-6  m=1  b=0  (design-demonstrated range: w=2.0u used by XRPTAT_COMP_S,
    l in 0.5u..1.107u; both strictly inside the demonstrated drawable range)
  weff = w + dw_rppd_par = 2.0e-6 + 0.006e-6 = 2.006e-6
  leff = (b+1)*l + (2/kappa*weff+ps)*b = l = 1.0e-6 (b=0)
  sheet term  = rsh_rppd * (leff/weff) / m = 260.0 * (1.0e-6 / 2.006e-6) / 1 = 129.611167 ohm
  contact term = rz = rzspec/w = 35e-6 / 2.0e-6 = 17.5 ohm per end
  R_total (two-end convention) = sheet + 2*rz = 129.611167 + 35.0 = 164.611167 ohm
  R_total (single-end convention) = sheet + rz = 147.111167 ohm (bracketing)
  coordinate: 73.7045910482929543 < R < 538.397754496273819
  R_total=164.611167 strictly inside: True (single-end 147.111167 also inside: True)
  Neither coordinate is treated as a device absolute maximum or reliability rule.

